  {
    "data": {
      "text": "Expansion of Thimphu city in 2002 added local areas of Lanjophaka, Heo-Samteling, Jungshi-Pamtsho, Taba and Dechencholing in the north and Changjiji, Lungtenphu, Simtokha, and Babesa in the south ( Fig."
