        "result": []
      }
    ],
    "id": 8
  },
  {
    "data": {
      "text": "These expediated changes can be attributed to: i) governments approval for expansion of the city in 2002, followed by the hastened construction of city infrastructure post Bhutan's transition to democracy in 2008."
    },
    "annotations": [
      {
        "id": "annotation_8",
